# the protocol catalog of the vault — the https protocols pillar (the wave D growth).
# One row per wire the domain serves static-safe: scheme|name|port|spec under a
# group head (the curated mesh rows carry security|state as the fifth and sixth
# fields). Generated programmatically from the family mesh of the argan gateway
# (231 curated rows with their governing specs and security postures) and the
# live IANA service name and transport protocol port number registry (the
# system port range 0-1023, the tcp preference over udp, descriptions and
# references verbatim).
# Every row answers one static-safe route on the domain: GET
# /api/v1/protocols/<scheme> serves the row — read-only, no storage truth, no
# query execution.
